{
  "$description": "GiftCard Waiter design tokens (W3C DTCG format). Source of truth: 04 Design System (Appendix A, tiers 1-2), 05 Component Library (tier 3), 06 Motion, 08 Responsive, 10 Assets, 11 Sound & Haptics. Consumed by tool/generate_tokens.dart, which validates this file and writes lib/core/tokens/tokens.g.dart. Units: dimensions are logical points (pt = dp = Flutter logical pixel) unless a string with 'px' (physical pixels) is given. Colour tokens carry {light, dark}; null means 'none' in that theme. '$extensions.highContrast' is the high-contrast override (04 §10.1), either a reference or {light, dark}; references inside an override resolve to the referenced token's normal (non-high-contrast) value. A group may carry a '$root' token so that 'color.danger' and 'color.danger.bg' can both exist; '{color.danger}' references the root. Types beyond the DTCG standard (09 §2.3): 'spring' {response s, damping ratio}, 'haptic' {ios, android.api30, android.fallback}, 'sound' {file, maxMs, loudnessLufsM, truePeakDbtp}, 'typography' is extended with textTransform and $extensions {maxScale, minSizeAfterShrink, truncate}.",
